          "end": 7.92,
          "en": "there are two things I wanna do with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.92,
          "end": 9.99,
          "en": "For one, we got these blue squiggly lines,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.99,
          "end": 12.715,
          "en": "and the question is, where's that coming from?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.715,
          "end": 14.31,
          "en": "Well, if we hover over it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.31,
          "end": 16.748,
          "en": "we see that Constructors for public widgets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 16.748,
          "end": 19.62,
          "en": "should have a named key parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.62,
          "end": 20.975,
          "en": "So, what's that about?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 20.975,
          "end": 23.46,
          "en": "In the end, your own widget classes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
