          "en": "as I explained a couple of lectures ago",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 285.642,
          "end": 287.7,
          "en": "in this section already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 287.7,
          "end": 290.94,
          "en": "So, with const in front of your constructor function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 290.94,
