          "en": "actually also are defined to be optimizable with const,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 308.464,
          "end": 312.24,
          "en": "you can even add const here in front of MaterialApp.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 312.24,
          "end": 314.16,
          "en": "Using that optimization technique",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 314.16,
          "end": 316.53,
          "en": "I mentioned before in the course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 316.53,
          "end": 318.824,
          "en": "now here, just also with your class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 318.824,
          "end": 322.08,
          "en": "unlocked to be optimizable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 322.08,
          "end": 325.241,
          "en": "And as always, the Code Editor will simply tell you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 325.241,
