          "en": "when you have an opportunity to unlock such optimizations,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 329.376,
          "end": 332.79,
          "en": "in this case, by telling us that we should add const here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 332.79,
          "end": 334.914,
          "en": "which is why I'm doing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 334.914,
          "end": 338.011,
          "en": "So, that was one thing I wanted to take a look at,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 338.011,
